-- The ship's tape shelf. Every string here is a translation key;
-- the text is in Translate/EN/Recorded_Media.json and both files
-- come out of the generator together, because a key that does not
-- resolve prints itself on screen and a key used twice makes the
-- second line silently inert. See LORE.md.

-- Vanilla's shared/RecordedMedia/ISRecordedMedia.lua registers
-- everything in this table on OnInitRecordedMedia, so adding to it
-- is the whole of the integration. The handler at the bottom is
-- insurance against a load order where our table is filled after
-- vanilla has already walked it, and it registers only what the
-- engine does not already have -- registering an id twice is not
-- something the engine is known to survive.
RecMedia = RecMedia or {}

